  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the yakimono-grill to medium-high heat",
    "In a bowl, mix together shrimp paste, feta cheese, kalamata olives, artichoke hearts, and sun-dried tomatoes",
    "Add lemon juice, olive oil, and pepper to the bowl and mix well",
    "Transfer the mixture to a cataplana vessel",
    "Grill the mixture for 10 minutes or until it reaches an internal temperature of 165 degrees",
    "Remove the vessel from the grill and let it cool for a few minutes",
    "Serve the Zesty Molten Greek Shrimp Grill hot, garnished with fresh parsley"
  ],
